[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m Vertical asymptotes occur where the denominator is zero and the numerator is non-zero. Therefore, we set the denominator equal to zero and solve for \( x \):
