[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m Next, we need to check if the numerator is zero at these points. The numerator is \( 2 \), which is a constant and never zero. Therefore, the function has vertical asymptotes at \( x = -3 \) and \( x = 2 \).
