[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 3. Take the cube root of the simplified expression.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m Let's start with the substitution:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m \left(16\sqrt[3]{8^2}\right)^{\frac{1}{3}}
