[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 1. For the \(x\)-terms:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m \[x^2 + 4x = (x + 2)^2 - 4.\]
