[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m - \(6 = 2 \times 3\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m - \(10 = 2 \times 5\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m The LCM is found by taking the highest power of each prime that appears in the factorizations:
