[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 1. Substitute \(a = 8\) into the expression.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 2. Simplify the expression inside the parentheses.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 3. Take the cube root of the simplified expression.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m Let's start with the substitution:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m \left(16\sqrt[3]{8^2}\right)^{\frac{1}{3}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m Next, simplify the expression inside the parentheses. First, calculate \(8^2\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 8^2 = 64
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m So the expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m \left(16\sqrt[3]{64}\right)^{\frac{1}{3}}
