[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m The game will be won before the fourth turn if the player wins on the first, second, or third turn. The probability of winning on the first turn is \(\frac{1}{6}\). The probability of winning on the second turn is the probability of not winning on the first turn and winning on the second turn, which is \(\frac{5}{6} \times \frac{1}{6} = \frac{5}{36}\). The probability of winning on the third turn is the probability of not winning on the first two turns and winning on the third turn, which is \(\left(\frac{5}{6}\right)^2 \times \frac{1}{6} = \frac{25}{216}\).
