[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 2. The probability of not winning on the first turn and winning on the second turn is \(\frac{5}{6} \times \frac{1}{6}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 3. The probability of not winning on the first two turns and winning on the third turn is \(\left(\frac{5}{6}\right)^2 \times \frac{1}{6}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 
