[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m assistant
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m [response] To solve the expression \(\left(16\sqrt[3]{a^2}\right)^{\frac{1}{3}}\) given that \(a = 8\), we will follow these steps:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 1. Substitute \(a = 8\) into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m    \left(16\sqrt[3]{8^2}\right)^{\frac{1}{3}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 2. Simplify the expression inside the cube root:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m    8^2 = 64 \implies \sqrt[3]{64} = 4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m    So the expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m    \left(16 \cdot 4\right)^{\frac{1}{3}} = \left(64\right)^{\frac{1}{3}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 3. Since \(64 = 4^3\), we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m    64^{\frac{1}{3}} = 4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=24255)[0m Therefore, the value of the expression is \(\boxed{4}\).
